# CLion
#  JetBrains specific template is maintained in a separate JetBrains.gitignore that can
#  be found at https://github.com/github/gitignore/blob/main/Global/JetBrains.gitignore
#  and can be added to the global gitignore or merged into this file.  For a more nuclear
#  option (not recommended) you can uncomment the following to ignore the entire idea folder.
#cmake-build-*

# Build directories
build/
build-*/
out/
cmake-build-*/

# Editors / IDEs
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
.DS_Store

# vphilox artifacts
# Benchmark JSON and PractRand logs are generated; the curated results that
# back the paper live in docs/benchmarks/ and docs/statistical/ and are tracked.
*.practrand.log
bench_results_*.json

# Temporary directory produced by `gcloud compute scp`. Curated files are copied
# into results/ before committing, and because it is ignored, anything left
# behind is invisible to `git status` and stays behind indefinitely. Drain it
# completely: the Pi baseline's environment capture sat here for four days while
# machines.csv carried blank arch and cpu columns for that run, because only the
# JSON beside it was copied across.
avx512-results/

# Python bytecode from the benchmark publishing script
__pycache__/
*.pyc
